          "severity": "minor",
          "file": "backend/AirlineDemo.Api.Tests/ReleaseIdentityContractTests.cs",
          "line": 276,
          "message": "The resolver still counts unresolved module and variable principals as app grants, so valid ACR grants to unrelated identities can fail the contract test.",
          "confidence": 0.88,
          "category": "logic-error",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "MayResolveToApp returns true for any var or module reference without resolving its value. AppAcrGrantRoles then counts that role assignment as an app grant when its scope references the ACR.",
            "failureScenario": "If a valid AcrPull grant on the ACR uses principal_id = module.other.principal_id for an unrelated identity, the contract test counts it alongside the app’s AcrPull grant and fails the exact-one assertion."
